|## Saving
1. Top up First Direct Current Account up to £2,000.
2. Top up Starling Savings (Emergency Fund) up to £10,000.
3. Pay off **high interest debt**.
4. **Allocate 50% of Remaining Funds to [[Assets & Liabilities#^c40157|Retirement Accounts]] subject [up to]((https://help.getpenfold.com/en/articles/3535090-is-there-a-maximum-i-can-pay-into-my-pension) £4,000/month.
5. **Allocate 50% of Remaining Funds to [[Assets & Liabilities#^fa8f6b|Investment Accounts]]**.



